{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0001", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Lower edge first. Tell me what's physically there, not what you think it means.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 13}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0002", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Worn smooth for about two fingers. Rest isn't.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 15}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0003", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "So it bears there when it moves.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 17}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0004", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Yeah.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 19}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0005", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Good. Different fact.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 21}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0006", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "This line comes back.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 25}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0007", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Where?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 27}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0008", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Up the frame, across, then behind your side.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 29}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0009", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "I have a return here. Maybe the same one. Maybe not. Don't let me marry those yet.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 33}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0010", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "What if the plates aren't separate controls?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 37}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0011", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Keep going.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 41}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0012", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Crest work can look like separate marks until you follow where the working closes.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 43}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0013", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "This isn't a Crest.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 45}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0014", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "I know. I'm talking about the relationship, not the origin.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 47}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B07_L0015", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Better.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[STORY TRIGGER — THE FOURTH PLATE]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_07_ANCIENT_BARRIER_FIRST_COOPERATION_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 51}},
